{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C2\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\", \"C1\"],\n  \"why\": \"keep：清单明确标注为无，因此四个候选在这一项没有可比较的指定保留内容，并列。cover：C2最完整地交代了他为什么愿意停留——记得那份安宁曾带给自己的满足，因此愿意暂时搁置未解之事；同时也交代了短暂松弛、欢喜和安静不会久留。C1也有过去满足这一理由，但没有明确写出暂时搁置未解之事和欢喜；C3、C4有不舍，却缺少过去经历如何促成此刻选择的交代。lean：C1的三个步骤各有作用，先认出柔软，再说服自己不必审问，最后得到短暂喘息；C2的认得与记得略有重复，C3、C4则重复铺陈了压下去、爱惜片刻和舍不得退去。plain：C3、C4最像一个人在直接说自己的心思，动作和情绪都具体；C2次之，C1的反问和审问自己的说法更像经过整理的心理判断。overall：C2的因果链最完整，既有过去真实满足过的经验，也有由此产生的当下选择和结果；C1次之，理由充分但情感收束略少；C3、C4虽然情感完整，却缺少让这次选择有来由的关键一环。C3与C4内容完全相同，应视为并列。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3afcf395-034f-471e-a45e-5d286a05f66e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T012937908679Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.829, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:30:25.726319+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b000fb24c0047c7ec190b29a95a309da1e22f6d462f87740defdb5d35099a7ac", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_c